[ti:A Good Idea]
[by:更多学习内容，请到VeryCD.com搜索“露珠”]

[00:00.67]Lesson 109 | 第109课
[00:03.27]A good idea | 好主意
[00:06.16]Listen to the tape then answer this question. | 听录音,然后回答这个问题。
[00:11.67]What does Jane have with her coffee? | 简的咖啡里加了什么?
[00:16.97]Shall I make some coffee, Jane? | 简,我来煮点咖啡好吗?
[00:21.76]That's a good idea, Charlotte. | 好主意,夏洛特。
[00:26.07]It's ready. | 煮好了。
[00:27.97]Do you want any milk? | 你要加些牛奶吗?
[00:30.94]Just a little, please. | 请加一点。
[00:34.43]What about some sugar? | 加些糖怎么样?
[00:37.46]Two teaspoonfuls? | 两茶匙?
[00:40.68]No, less than that. | 不,少一些。
[00:43.63]One and a half teaspoonfuls, please. | 请加一茶匙半。
[00:48.29]That's enough for me. | 我够了。
[00:52.03]That was very nice. | 非常好喝。
[00:55.25]Would you like some more? | 你要再来一些吗?
[00:58.05]Yes, please. | 好的,请再来一些。
[01:01.40]I'd like a cigarette, too. | 我还想抽支烟。
[01:04.85]May I have one? | 我能抽一支吗?
[01:07.50]Of course. | 当然可以。
[01:09.46]I think there are a few in that box. | 我想那个盒子里有几支。
[01:14.67]I'm afraid it's empty. | 恐怕盒子是空的。
[01:18.18]What a pity! | 真可惜!
[01:20.50]It doesn't matter. | 没关系。
[01:23.23]Have a biscuit instead. | 吃块饼干吧。
[01:26.22]Eat more and smoke less! | 多吃少抽!
[01:30.32]That's very good advice! | 这是非常好的建议!